WHY THIS LICENSE EXISTS
=======================================================================

MEKRA-X is what ZSL-X was reaching toward. It keeps the same
generous core — use it, learn from it, change it, build with it,
give improvements back — and tightens the three things that
matter if ZYRAXON is going to be a real business that real
people depend on:

    1. You may not sell it.
    2. You may not publish a modified version as your own.
    3. You may not remove the systems that make it work.

The reason is not gatekeeping. It is that a paid product whose
value comes from its systems should not be able to be copied
into a free competitor by removing the very parts that make it
worth paying for. Everything else stays open, on purpose.

If you only want to use ZYRAXON, this license never limits you.
Read Section 4 and start building.

